    "turn_text": "That's actually a very important point because we saw the sales starting so early. There is some speculation from analysts that Consumers are pretty much done with their holiday shopping by now and it really pushed a lot of sales into November. And we might not see big promotions or really a lot of spending in December itself. And that's something that retailers have to be concerned about is whether this is actually a true improvement in what consumers are spending or if they were just spending more earlier and that December is really going to be dead time for them.",
