    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/9/89389.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 165,
    "turn_text": "Well, that is part of the point of what needs to happen is we need what analysts are calling global rebalancing. So if you compare, for example, the United States and China, we've been like mirror images. We've been spending too much and saving too little. They've been saving too much and spending too little. So we need to readjust so that that other countries, including the Chinese, are spending more and therefore fueling our exports.",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_07",
    "inferred_speaker_name": null,
    "inferred_speaker_role": null,
    "chosen_text_key": "transcript",
    "explicit_propositions": [
