        "text": "Global rebalancing is necessary.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "The United States has been spending too much and saving too little.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "China has been saving too much and spending too little.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The U.S. and China have been economic mirror images.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
