  },
  {
    "episode_id": 89389,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/9/89389.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 168,
    "turn_text": "Yes, we are. And that's an excellent point. I agree with Kelly and Derek about all these positive signs about consumer spending, but we need to remember that it's not going to be sustainable unless we get those jobs.",
