    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/9/89389.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 170,
    "turn_text": "Well, so it's a bit of a self-reinforcing cycle in the sense that as confidence grows, as pent-up demand is released, businesses will feel more comfortable hiring, and we'll see hiring across the economy rise.",
