    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/9/89389.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 199,
    "turn_text": "You've got over a billion people in China who are suddenly plugged in to the global economy. And that means competition is going to be much more fierce. And the winners of this competition will be the countries that have the most educated workers. a serious commitment to research and technology and access to quality infrastructure like roads and airports and high-speed rail and high-speed internet",
